Polar Shiv is a soft drink made by [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] and manufactured by [[Org/Ternion Heavy Industries/index|Ternion Heavy Industries]]. The cans have openers attached and no pull-tabs, and Ternion enchanted them to chill themselves when opened. It is advertised as the Taste of Austrene.

The drink comes in two versions, one with [[Phenomena/Shiver|shiver]] mixed in and one without. A sip cools and tingles through the mouth and throat, dulling sensation, calming the drinker and easing fear, and it brings on drowsiness. One can does little harm, but a person who drinks several in a row or makes a habit of them will become addicted, and shiver is hard to shake. Arctos settled on a lower dose and a drug-free version, Polar Shiv Zero, and he sends crates of both to his companions.

At the [[Sin and Tonic]], [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anouk Marchal|Anouk]] and [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anaïs Marchal|Anaïs]] like the shiver version, Anouk comparing the taste to Toothpaste Worm, and [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Dura Oil-Drinker|Dura]] likes it too. [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Elias Ramsey|Elias]] will not drink it, and [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Gin Soaked Rag|Ginny]] cannot.
